# {{.Recipe.Name}}

This is a customer-owned feature-flag service generated by SaaS Reaper.
It contains the application, selected persistence mechanism, deployment pack,
domain record, and agent instructions. It does not call home to SaaS Reaper.

Start with `WORK.md`. It binds the current work to the immutable generation
receipt and names only the outcome, invariants, allowed paths, proof, stop
conditions, evidence, and handoff. Validate it with `make work`; it is not an
authority grant or a replacement for executable checks.

